# A play-through from NEW GAME to the first battle, recorded by playing.
#
# Frame numbers index the port's own frames, one per game step, so this replays
# exactly only under FRLG_LOCKSTEP -- it was recorded under FRLG_LOCKSTEP=pace
# for that reason (docs/adr/0013, docs/adr/0014). It is not portable to mGBA:
# the reference loses V-blanks this port does not, so the same inputs land in
# different places (docs/spikes/0009).
#
# It has already earned its keep twice -- the battle transition's freed-pointer
# read, and the save blocks shuffling into the music players -- and both were
# only reachable by playing this far.
#
